      en: ["The stadium was officially opened to the public in 1983.", "It has a maximum spectator capacity of about 30,000.", "The venue is located at the junction of Lang'ata Road and Uhuru Highway.", "The name 'Nyayo' is a Swahili word meaning 'footsteps'.", "The complex features an aquatic center with an Olympic-size pool.", "It was the primary venue for the 2010 African Championships in Athletics."],
