      hu: ["2017-ben nyitották meg Miritini-ben", "Építészete a víz hullámait szimbolizálja", "A nairobi SGR vonal végállomása", "Több ezer utas befogadására alkalmas", "A Madaraka Express fő tengerparti csomópontja", "Modern üveghomlokzatos kialakítás"],
      ro: ["Inaugurat în anul 2017 la Miritini", "Arhitectura simbolizează valurile mării", "Stația terminus a liniei SGR din Nairobi", "Capacitate pentru mii de pasageri zilnic", "Nodul principal pentru Madaraka Express", "Design modern cu fațade de sticlă"],
      en: ["Opened in 2017 in the Miritini area", "Architecture represents ripples in water", "Coastal terminus of the SGR from Nairobi", "Capacity to handle thousands of daily travelers", "Terminal for the popular Madaraka Express", "Located approximately 11 km from Mombasa CBD"],
