      en: ["The building was officially inaugurated by President Uhuru Kenyatta in May 2022.", "It stands at a height of 133 meters and comprises 27 floors.", "The design features two distinct leaning towers that lean towards each other.", "It is owned by the Central Bank of Kenya (CBK) Pension Fund.", "The building is located on Harambee Avenue in the Upper Hill district.", "It was designed to be environmentally friendly with sustainable energy systems."],
