      en: ["The monument was officially unveiled in October 2011.", "It is located on Moi Avenue, steps away from where he was shot in 1969.", "Tom Mboya died at the age of 38 and was buried on Rusinga Island.", "The bronze statue celebrates his role as a pan-Africanist and labor leader.", "He played a crucial role in negotiating Kenya's independence from Britain.", "The monument cost approximately 20 million Kenyan Shillings to construct."],
